    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "###Priya’s plan\nPriya is making a page to save her neighborhood park.\n\n- Theme: Save Maple Park\n- Audience: Neighbors\n- Purpose: Get people to sign a petition\n- Look & Feel: Hopeful and warm",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/66ce3d6cc909f3b9bbd60c4279c26068-01-priya-start-1600.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-words-79326ee0-7678-4853-a478-b11db7a3f323"
      },
      {
        "text": "###The AI’s first try\nThe AI built a page. It has a hopeful headline and a warm intro. The button says Submit.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/22c3bf1346290b7889af3cb97dbfc330-02-priya-page-1600.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-words-b91a0613-e4c8-4f71-b049-3644ed36e60d"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Priya checks her plan\nPriya checks the page against her plan. The purpose doesn’t fit. \n\nA button that says Submit doesn’t tell neighbors what they’re signing.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6440b96c5009b3c1eb3c877466d411ed-03-priya-review-1600.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-words-66090432-4a76-4e54-9810-8b4da0e1f2f4"
      },
      {
        "text": "Priya’s button just says Submit, but her plan says the page should get people to sign a petition. \n\n**What advice would you give Priya?**\n\n- A. “Ask the AI to make the whole page more persuasive for your neighbors.”\n- B. “Ask the AI to make the headline bigger and a brighter green.”\n- C. “Ask the AI to make the call-to-action say Sign the petition.” ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b7ceb7dff93139e347e0eebb59518667-blue-background-1600x900 (1).png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-words-ff5b6e8b-ada9-4c1c-8d70-44fc030697e6",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "The correct answer is C. A call-to-action that says Sign the petition tells neighbors exactly what to do. \n\n---\n\n**Tip:** When the words are off, name the part and give the AI the exact words you want.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3f1aafd12b811dedbba2d4cd643d5664-Clear prompts spark bright ideas.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-words-5c62df09-20e1-4981-a5e7-eb8adfa24c6d",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "use_links": "false"
  },
